 int dp(int value){return Math.round(value*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density);}
 TextView label(String s,int size){TextView v=new TextView(this);v.setText(s);v.setTextSize(size);v.setTextColor(text);v.setPadding(0,dp(8),0,dp(8));return v;}
 TextView button(String s,Runnable action){TextView v=label(s,15);v.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);GradientDrawable d=new GradientDrawable();d.setColor(card);d.setCornerRadius(dp(16));v.setBackground(d);LinearLayout.LayoutParams lp=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,dp(48));lp.bottomMargin=dp(8);v.setLayoutParams(lp);v.setOnClickListener(x->action.run());return v;}
 void space(LinearLayout body,int h){body.addView(new View(this),new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(1,dp(h)));}
 void state(boolean working,String message){busy=working;progress.setVisibility(working?View.VISIBLE:View.GONE);status.setText(message);}
 void record(){if(busy)return;if(recorder!=null){finishRecording();return;}if(checkSelfPermission(android.Manifest.permission.RECORD_AUDIO)!=android.content.pm.PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED){requestPermissions(new String[]{android.Manifest.permission.RECORD_AUDIO},3);return;}if(LiveCall.current!=null){status.setText(I18n.t("Заверши звонок перед записью"));return;}stopPlayer();try{recording=new File(getCacheDir(),"lab-record-"+System.currentTimeMillis()+".m4a");recorder=new MediaRecorder();recorder.setAudioSource(MediaRecorder.AudioSource.MIC);recorder.setOutputFormat(MediaRecorder.OutputFormat.MPEG_4);recorder.setAudioEncoder(MediaRecorder.AudioEncoder.AAC);recorder.setAudioSamplingRate(32000);recorder.setAudioChannels(1);recorder.setAudioEncodingBitRate(96000);recorder.setMaxDuration(120000);recorder.setOutputFile(recording.getAbsolutePath());recorder.setOnInfoListener((r,w,e)->{if(w==MediaRecorder.MEDIA_RECORDER_INFO_MAX_DURATION_REACHED)finishRecording();});recorder.prepare();recorder.start();started=SystemClock.elapsedRealtime();recordKey.setText(I18n.t("■ Закончить запись"));ui.post(meter);}catch(Exception e){releaseRecorder();status.setText(I18n.t("Не удалось начать запись. Проверь доступ к микрофону."));}}
 void finishRecording(){File file=recording;boolean valid=false;try{recorder.stop();valid=file!=null&&file.length()>500&&SystemClock.elapsedRealtime()-started>700;}catch(Exception ignored){}releaseRecorder();if(valid)load(Uri.fromFile(file));else status.setText(I18n.t("Запись слишком короткая. Попробуй ещё раз."));}
 void releaseRecorder(){ui.removeCallbacks(meter);if(recorder!=null){try{recorder.release();}catch(Exception ignored){}recorder=null;}if(recordKey!=null)recordKey.setText(I18n.t("Записать голос"));}
 void load(Uri uri){stopPlayer();state(true,I18n.t("Открываем аудио…"));final int seq=++generation;work.execute(()->{try{short[] data=AudioCodec.decode(this,uri);File file=new File(getCacheDir(),"lab-original-"+seq+".wav");AudioCodec.wav(file,data,AudioCodec.RATE);runOnUiThread(()->{if(isDestroyed()||seq!=generation){file.delete();return;}if(sourceFile!=null)sourceFile.delete();if(resultFile!=null)resultFile.delete();sourceFile=file;resultFile=null;original=data;processed=null;cutEnabled.setChecked(false);cutStart.setProgress(0);cutEnd.setProgress(1000);wave.samples(data);state(false,I18n.t("Аудио готово · ")+String.format(java.util.Locale.ROOT,"%.1f",data.length/(float)AudioCodec.RATE)+I18n.t(" с"));});}catch(Exception e){runOnUiThread(()->state(false,Api.message(e)));}});}
 void process(){if(original==null){status.setText(LegalCenter.tr("Сначала загрузи или запиши аудио","Load or record audio first"));return;}if(busy||recorder!=null)return;stopPlayer();final int mode=effect,seq=++generation;final float amount=strength.getProgress()/100f;final short[] input=original;final boolean cut=cutEnabled.isChecked();final int begin=(int)(input.length*(long)cutStart.getProgress()/1000),end=(int)(input.length*(long)cutEnd.getProgress()/1000);if(cut&&end<=begin){status.setText(I18n.t("Конец фрагмента должен быть позже начала"));return;}state(true,I18n.t("Обрабатываем звук…"));work.execute(()->{try{short[] filtered=AudioDsp.process(input,AudioCodec.RATE,mode,amount);final short[] data=cut?AudioDsp.muteRange(filtered,AudioCodec.RATE,begin,end):filtered;File output=new File(getCacheDir(),"lab-result-"+seq+".wav");AudioCodec.wav(output,data,AudioCodec.RATE);runOnUiThread(()->{if(isDestroyed()||seq!=generation){output.delete();return;}if(resultFile!=null)resultFile.delete();processed=data;resultFile=output;wave.samples(data);state(false,I18n.t("Готово. Сравни оригинал и результат."));});}catch(Exception e){runOnUiThread(()->state(false,Api.message(e)));}});}
 void play(File file){if(file==null){status.setText(LegalCenter.tr("Сначала загрузи аудио и подготовь результат","Load audio and prepare a result first"));return;}if(busy||recorder!=null)return;stopPlayer();try{player=new MediaPlayer();player.setAudioAttributes(new AudioAttributes.Builder().setUsage(AudioAttributes.USAGE_MEDIA).setContentType(AudioAttributes.CONTENT_TYPE_SPEECH).build());player.setDataSource(file.getAbsolutePath());player.setOnPreparedListener(p->{p.start();status.setText(file.equals(sourceFile)?LegalCenter.tr("Играет оригинал","Playing original"):LegalCenter.tr("Играет результат","Playing processed audio"));});player.setOnCompletionListener(p->{stopPlayer();status.setText(LegalCenter.tr("Прослушивание завершено","Playback finished"));});player.prepareAsync();}catch(Exception e){status.setText(I18n.t("Не удалось воспроизвести запись"));}}
 void stopPlayer(){if(player!=null){try{player.release();}catch(Exception ignored){}player=null;}}
 protected void onActivityResult(int request,int result,Intent data){super.onActivityResult(request,result,data);if(result!=RESULT_OK||data==null||data.getData()==null)return;Uri uri=data.getData();if(request==1)load(uri);if(request==2&&resultFile!=null){final File file=resultFile;state(true,I18n.t("Сохраняем…"));work.execute(()->{try(InputStream in=new FileInputStream(file);OutputStream out=getContentResolver().openOutputStream(uri)){byte[] block=new byte[16384];int n;while((n=in.read(block))>=0)out.write(block,0,n);runOnUiThread(()->state(false,I18n.t("Файл сохранён")));}catch(Exception e){runOnUiThread(()->state(false,I18n.t("Не удалось сохранить файл")));}});}}
 public void onRequestPermissionsResult(int r,String[] p,int[] g){super.onRequestPermissionsResult(r,p,g);if(r==3&&g.length>0&&g[0]==0)record();}
 protected void onPause(){stopPlayer();if(recorder!=null)finishRecording();super.onPause();}
 protected void onDestroy(){generation++;releaseRecorder();stopPlayer();work.shutdownNow();if(sourceFile!=null)sourceFile.delete();if(resultFile!=null)resultFile.delete();if(recording!=null)recording.delete();super.onDestroy();}
 static final class AudioWave extends View{float[] values=new float[70];final Paint p=new Paint(3);AudioWave(Context c){super(c);}void level(int value){System.arraycopy(values,1,values,0,values.length-1);values[values.length-1]=VoiceCapture.Wave.normalized(value);invalidate();}void samples(short[] data){for(int i=0;i<values.length;i++){int start=i*data.length/values.length,end=(i+1)*data.length/values.length;float peak=0;for(int j=start;j<end;j++)peak=Math.max(peak,Math.abs((int)data[j])/32768f);values[i]=peak;}invalidate();}protected void onDraw(Canvas c){p.setColor(0xff72eee1);p.setStrokeWidth(Math.max(2,getWidth()/105f));p.setStrokeCap(Paint.Cap.ROUND);for(int i=0;i<values.length;i++){float x=(i+.5f)*getWidth()/values.length,h=Math.max(3,values[i]*getHeight()*.85f);c.drawLine(x,(getHeight()-h)/2,x,(getHeight()+h)/2,p);}}}
